WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.590
A useful handout begins with a reader and
a task.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:08.530
Imagine a neighbor who wants computer
help. Put the service

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:12.470
and next action near the beginning. Leave
out details that

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:17.110
do not help the person decide what to do,
and explain unfamiliar terms.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:22.420
Use real heading styles for sections, a
short numbered list

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:26.880
for steps, and link text that explains the
destination. Making

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:30.160
a line bold can change its appearance
without creating a

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:34.600
heading. Check that the structure still
makes sense when you

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:36.020
read the document in order.

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:41.050
In a practice workbook, enter paper at
twelve dollars, folders

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:46.010
at eight, and pens at five. The total is
twenty-five.

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:49.730
Use a sum formula over all three cells.
Change paper

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:54.050
to fifteen and check that the total
becomes twenty-eight. This

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:56.150
tests the formula rather than its
appearance.

00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:01.100
The right file format depends on the next
person's task.

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:08.060
An editable document supports revision. A
PDF often preserves a

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:13.220
finished layout. A CSV carries plain table
data but loses

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:17.940
formatting and formulas. Choose
deliberately, then reopen the exported

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:19.720
file and check what survived.

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:25.070
Create a small resource pack: a structured
handout, a checked

00:01:25.070 --> 00:01:30.210
workbook, and three clear slides. Credit
any reused material according

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:35.450
to its license. Show a partner the
calculation and the

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:38.830
exported handout. Ask them to find the
next action without

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:41.310
your help, then improve anything unclear.
